<DocsExample TExample="BubblePackBasicExample" Title="Basic bubbles" Description="Bubble pack sizes each circle by its value and packs them together. It suits comparing many items where exact positions do not matter." />
<DocsExample TExample="BubblePackDrilldownExample" Title="Groups and drill-down" Description="GroupSelector gathers items into group bubbles. Select a group to zoom into its members and use Back to return." />
<DocsExample TExample="BubblePackSizingExample" Title="Bubble sizing" Description="MinBubbleRadius and MaxBubbleRadius keep tiny items visible and huge items contained. TargetFillRatio sets how much of the chart the bubbles cover." />
<DocsExample TExample="BubblePackPhysicsExample" Title="Physics and motion" Description="Gravity, collision strength and damping tune how bubbles settle and react when dragged. Lower damping settles faster; higher gravity packs tighter." />
<DocsExample TExample="BubblePackZoomExample" Title="Zoom" Description="Set Interactions to a zoom flag so readers can scale the whole pack with the mouse wheel or a pinch to inspect crowded areas." />
